  "Choose your camera and incoming-ball settings, then start Quick Practice. Top-down court lets you drag the opponent and landing zones. Rally also includes your configured return ball toward the blue zone.": "选择视点和来球设置，然后开始快速练习。在俯视球场中可拖动对手和落点区域。对拉还包含按设置回向蓝色区域的球员回球。",
  "Choose a drill to run, duplicate, export or edit. Custom drills stay in this browser.": "选择训练进行练习、复制、导出或编辑。自定义训练保存在此浏览器中。",
  "Select an opening or player shot to edit it. WASD moves its player camera; drag to look and wheel to zoom. In Top-down zones, drag the opening opponent, blue player landing or yellow opponent landing. Drag presets onto the timeline and right-click to remove a shot. Preview sequence below the court plays the full drill.": "选择开场或球员击球进行编辑。WASD 移动视点，拖动观察，滚轮缩放。在俯视落点中可拖动开场对手、蓝色球员落点或黄色对手落点。将预设拖入时间轴，右键移除击球。球场下方的预览序列可播放完整训练。",
  "Protected controls use fullscreen keyboard access so Ctrl+W/S reach the court.": "按键保护使用全屏键盘权限，将 Ctrl+W/S 操作交给球场。",
